        "attribution": "Caves supplied the decisive quantum-measurement insight, while Kimble and Mavalvala represent major experimental realization and impact.",
        "maturity": "The method is established in precision experiments, most visibly gravitational-wave detection, and its quantum basis is secure.",
        "uncertainties": [
